# Mobile Firebase is configured only by the native files apps/mobile/google-services.json and
# apps/mobile/GoogleService-Info.plist (never tracked). On EAS, upload them as file environment
# variables named GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON and GOOGLE_SERVICE_INFO_PLIST.

# Desktop values belong in apps/desktop/.env.local using apps/desktop/.env.example.
# MCP server values belong in services/mcp/.env using services/mcp/.env.example.
# Never put service accounts, OAuth secrets/tokens, signing keys, or real user data here.
